    ...    ${NUM_MAX_PRB_DEFAULT} - (${config_blanking.nbBlankedPRBsHighEdge}[2] + ${config_blanking.nbBlankedPRBsLowEdge}[2])
    ...                               ELSE    Set Variable    ${NUM_MAX_PRB_DEFAULT}
